===Etymology===
From {{etyl|dum|nl}} {{term|cunst|lang=dum}}, {{term|const|lang=dum}}, {{term|cunste|lang=dum}}, {{term|conste||skill, ability, knowledge, craft|lang=dum}}, from {{etyl|odt|nl}} *{{term||kunst|knowledge, know-how, skill|lang=odt}}, from {{proto|Germanic|kunstiz|knowledge, ability|lang=nl}}, from {{proto|Indo-European|ǵenǝ-||ǵnō-|to know|lang=nl}}, equivalent to ''[[kunnen|kun(nen)]]'' + ''[[-st#Dutch|-st]]''. Cognate with {{etyl|osx|-}} {{term|kunst||skill, wisdom|lang=osx}}, {{etyl|goh|-}} {{term|kunst||knowledge, wisdon, skill|lang=goh}}, {{etyl|ofs|-}} {{term|kunst|lang=ofs}}, {{term|konst|lang=ofs}}, {{term|kenst||knowledge|lang=ofs}}. More at {{l|en|cunning}}.

